{"type":"Film","id":"HR2019_005","slug":"hr2019-005-lada-kamenski","title":{"native":"Lada Kamenski","english":"Lada Kamenski"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2019-03-07","year":2019},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Sara Hribar","slug":"sara-hribar","name":"Sara Hribar","birthYear":1986,"deathYear":2025,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Croatia","awards":[]},{"id":"Marko Šantić","slug":"marko-santic","name":"Marko Šantić","birthYear":1983,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Croatia","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt8601284/mediaviewer/rm2935178240/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KzEalMjwLWU&ab_channel=Peglanjesnova"},"synopsis":{"native":"Frano je mladi redatelj koji priprema svoj prvi film. U središtu su radnje žene pogođene slomom krojačke industrije u regiji, a nadahnuće za priču pronašao je u svojoj teti, bivšoj radnici u tvornici Kamensko. Kako bi odlučio tko će tumačiti glavni lik, Frano poziva tri renomirane glumice na neformalnu čitaću probu u svoj stan. Međutim, kada glumice shvate da se natječu jedna protiv druge, stvari krenu u pogrešnom smjeru.","english":"Frano, a film director, is preparing his debut feature, which will focus on women affected by the collapse of the textile industry in the region. The topic, as well as the main character, is inspired by his aunt who used to work in the industry. In order to find the star of the film, he invites three esteemed actresses to his apartment for an informal reading rehearsal. However, as soon as they realise they are competing against each other for the lead role, things take an unexpected turn."},"production":[{"country":"Croatia","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"HR2019_005_01","film":"HR2019_005","person":{"id":"Nataša Dorčić","slug":"natasa-dorcic","name":"Nataša Dorčić","birthYear":1968,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nation